> **SELF-EXCLUSION.** Doubao-Seed-Evolving is a real, actively served ByteDance model (Volcano Engine Ark, model ID `doubao-seed-evolving`) with rich official specs and extensive third-party hands-on coverage — but **no verified public benchmark numbers were found for this exact model/ID** after extensive multi-engine research (see evidence trail). With zero measured numbers on any standard axis, no 1–100 scores are filed; the notes below are the verified facts only.

## Model card (verified facts only)

- **Name:** Doubao Seed Evolving (Doubao-Seed-Evolving)
- **Short description:** ByteDance Seed's rolling, versionless flagship-tier model on Volcano Engine Ark — described by the platform as "Seed's newest Coding & Agent model, iterated weekly" (快速迭代模型, 周级迭代). It supersedes the fixed `doubao-seed-2-1-pro-*` checkpoints for teams that want continuous updates instead of version migrations.
- **Provider / access:** Volcengine Ark (China; `doubao-seed-evolving`; CNY billing), resold by Ofox (`volcengine/doubao-seed-evolving`) and free inside the Volcengine Ark Coding Plan; Doubao / TRAE ecosystem. No OpenCode Zen route.
- **Release / knowledge:** rolling model ID (no dated version); first surfaced publicly alongside the Seed 2.1 generation launch on 2026-06-23; the 1M-context upgrade arrived in later iterations; knowledge cutoff not published.
- **IDs:** `doubao-seed-evolving` (Volcengine Ark) / `volcengine/doubao-seed-evolving` (Ofox).
- **Context window:** 1,024K total (max input 1,024K); max answer 256K (default 4K); max chain-of-thought 256K; rate limits 500 RPM / 1M TPM (Ark model list).
- **Modalities:** text, image, video in; text out; deep thinking; GUI task processing; tool calling (function calling, knowledge base, MCP, web plugin, image process); structured output; implicit + explicit (prefix/session) caching.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-14):** ≈$0.8906 in / $4.453 out per 1M on Volcengine Ark (Ofox: $0.884/$4.42; coding-plan lane $0/$0). CNY list on Ark: ¥6 / ¥30 per 1M with cached input and a batch tier.
- **Architecture:** undisclosed (proprietary), same Ark capability profile as the Seed 2.1 line; a "weekly iteration" service model rather than a frozen checkpoint.

