### Why the file is excluded (evidence trail)

- Official specs and pricing were fetched and verified (Volcengine Ark model list; models.dev canonical entry).
- Extensive third-party coverage exists — 30+ CSDN hands-on project reports, WeChat/知乎 reviews, Tencent Cloud dev-community analysis, DTinsight launch coverage — but all retrieved material is qualitative (project walkthroughs, demos, capability descriptions). No benchmark table, leaderboard row, or numeric evaluation was found for `doubao-seed-evolving`.
- Search access this run: the websearch tool was unavailable (HTTP 402); DuckDuckGo later served bot challenges, and Sogou/Baidu intermittently rate-limited. Research used direct page fetches plus fallback search paths (Baidu mobile/desktop, Sogou, CSDN search API); all cited URLs were actually fetched.
- Per `model-report-TEMPLATE.md` / `.agents/rules.md`, zero verified benchmark numbers for the exact ID → self-exclusion; no placeholder score invented.
- Re-research trigger: any dated, sourced benchmark row for `doubao-seed-evolving` (vendor or independent) → write a scored `DeepSeek_4.1_Flash.md` and retire this twin.

